ons hide\n   a Hidden Service behind a fronting service, only disclosing the SNI\n   of the fronting service to external observers.  The draft lists known\n   attacks against SNI encryption, discusses the current \"co-tenancy\n   fronting\" solution, and presents requirements for future TLS layer\n   solutions.\n\n   In practice, it may well be that no solution can meet every\n   requirement, and that practical solutions will have to make some\n   compromises.\n", "ad": "/api/v1/person/person/115214/", "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-sni-encryption/", "expires": "2020-02-16T22:06:49Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 248084, "intended_std_level": "/api/v1/name/intendedstdlevelname/inf/", "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-sni-encryption", "note": "", "notify": "Sean Turner <sean@sn3rd.com>, Joseph Salowey <joe@salowey.net>", "pages": 14, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/248084/", "rev": "05", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": "/api/v1/person/email/joe@salowey.net/", "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/111/", "/api/v1/doc/state/15/", "/api/v1/doc/state/44/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2019-08-19T13:59:05Z", "title": "Issues and Requirements for SNI Encryption in TLS", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This draft describes the general problem of encrypting the Server\n   Name Identification (SNI) TLS parameter.  The proposed solutions hide\n   a Hidden Service behind a fronting service, only disclosing the SNI\n   of the fronting service to external observers.  The draft lists known\n   attacks against SNI encryption, discusses the current \"co-tenancy\n   fronting\" solution, and presents requirements for future TLS layer\n   solutions.\n\n   In practice, it may well be that no solution can meet every\n   requirement, and that practical solutions will have to make some\n   compromises.\n", "ad": "/api/v1/person/person/115214/", "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-sni-encryption/", "expires": "2020-02-16T22:06:49Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 248593, "intended_std_level": "/api/v1/name/intendedstdlevelname/inf/", "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-sni-encryption", "note": "", "notify": "Sean Turner <sean@sn3rd.com>, Joseph Salowey <joe@salowey.net>", "pages": 14, "resource_uri": "/api/v1/doc/dochistory/248593/", "rev": "05", "rfc_number": null, "shepherd": "/api/v1/person/email/joe@salowey.net/", "states": ["/api/v1/doc/state/1/", "/api/v1/doc/state/113/", "/api/v1/doc/state/15/", "/api/v1/doc/state/44/"], "std_level": null, "stream": "/api/v1/name/streamname/ietf/", "tags": [], "time": "2019-08-30T15:50:52Z", "title": "Issues and Requirements for SNI Encryption in TLS", "type": "/api/v1/name/doctypename/draft/", "uploaded_filename": "", "words": null}, {"abstract": "   This draft describes the general problem of encrypting the Server\n   Name Identification (SNI) TLS parameter.  The proposed solutions hide\n   a Hidden Service behind a fronting service, only disclosing the SNI\n   of the fronting service to external observers.  The draft lists known\n   attacks against SNI encryption, discusses the current \"co-tenancy\n   fronting\" solution, and presents requirements for future TLS layer\n   solutions.\n\n   In practice, it may well be that no solution can meet every\n   requirement, and that practical solutions will have to make some\n   compromises.\n", "ad": "/api/v1/person/person/115214/", "doc": "/api/v1/doc/document/draft-ietf-tls-sni-encryption/", "expires": "2020-02-16T22:06:49Z", "external_url": "", "group": "/api/v1/group/group/1326/", "id": 248658, "intended_std_level": "/api/v1/name/intendedstdlevelname/inf/", "keywords": "[]", "name": "draft-ietf-tls-sni-encryption", "note": "", "notify": "Sean Turner <sean@sn3rd.com>, Joseph Salowey <joe@salowey.net>", "pages": 14, "